sVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Destructive_Wave:_Necrotic\" title=\"Destructive Wave: Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp/40px-Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp/60px-Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp/80px-Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Destructive Wave: Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp/40px-Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Destructive_Wave:_Necrotic\" title=\"Destructive Wave: Necrotic\">Destructive Wave: Necrotic</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Destructive_Wave:_Radiant\" title=\"Destructive Wave: Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp/40px-Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp/60px-Destructive_Wave_Icon.webp 1